  m_text: 'OPERATIVE: 124-AI (You) LOCATION: The Balcony (Sector 7 - "The High Ground")
    WEAPON: RPG-7 (Standard Issue)


    THE PAYLOAD: One (1) High-Density Polymer
    Waste Containment Unit (AKA: The Trash Bag). Note: The bag is currently rated
    "Indestructible" due to the week-old lasagna inside solidifying into concrete.


    THE
    OBJECTIVE: The Sanitation Transport (Garbage Truck) arrives in 2 minutes. You
    are currently in your pajamas on the second floor. You do not want to walk downstairs.


    THE
    MISSION: Execute a "Ballistic Transfer." Use the RPG''s explosion force to launch
    the payload across the street and into the Dumpster.


    COLLATERAL RISK: The
    Neighbor''s Vehicle''s are parked in the line of fire. He just waxed it. Do not
    hit the car. Command estimates a 40% chance of neighborhood war if the car is
    scratched.'
